<b>be</b>

22:34.895 --> 22:38.935
<b>ba</b>

22:34.895 --> 22:38.935
<b>ii?”</b>

22:34.895 --> 22:38.935
<b></b>

22:34.895 --> 22:38.935
<b>"Apa yang harus kita pilih?"</b>

